spans.s:
वि-लोडित, अस्, आ, अम्, agitated, shaken, churned;
rolling or tumbling on the ground; (अम्), n. butter-
milk (= तक्र).

वि-लोप, अस्, m. carrying off, seizing, taking away;
a break or interruption in the Saṃhitā (according
to the Prātiśākhyas).

वि-लोक्य, ind. having looked at, having seen or
observed, having perceived or noticed or witnessed;
having regard to, paying attention to.
